  "id": "sonography",
  "term": "sonography",
  "definition": "In this context, sonography refers to transcranial Doppler sonography, a neurosonological method used to monitor blood-flow patterns in the brain. It can help detect signs such as reduced cerebral perfusion and increased vascular resistance in people with vascular cognitive impairment.",
